          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "chris.kleckner@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Feb 06 2024 23:11:48 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2>The Science Behind Support Surfaces</h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Stryker in partnership with Becker’s Healthcare are presenting an on-demand webinar focusing on the utilization of support surfaces technology for prevention and treatment of pressure injuries. Participants will be introduced to the different types of surfaces technologies, terminologies and discuss the clinical benefits of gel and air surfaces.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"standalone-link\"><a href=\"https://www.stryker.com/us/en/acute-care/c/the-science-behind-support-surfaces.html\" title=\"Learn more about support surfaces\">Learn more</a></span></p>\n",
